WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:09.749
Emmy piled pillows onto a chair.

2
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:14.124
"I'm Queen Emmy.

3
00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:21.168
And this is my throne."

4
00:00:21.169 --> 00:00:25.657
"Harry and I want to play too," Oliver said.

5
00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.229
"Okay," Emmy said.

6
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.886
"You're my court jester—make me laugh!"

7
00:00:32.887 --> 00:00:38.599
Oliver told a joke and Emmy laughed.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.972
"Harry, you're my guard," Emmy said.

9
00:00:42.973 --> 00:00:48.499
"Stand beside my throne and don't move."

10
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.916
Harry stood still.

11
00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:55.457
Mom peeked into the living room.

12
00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:58.787
"Royal cook!" Emmy cried.

13
00:00:58.788 --> 00:01:01.099
"Bring me cookies!"

14
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:07.625
Mom laughed. "Yes, Your Majesty."

15
00:01:07.626 --> 00:01:15.766
Mom returned with cookies.

16
00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:19.812
Rover and Dad came too.

17
00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:25.208
"Welcome, royal beast and trainer!" Emmy said.

18
00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:32.385
Rover sat and Dad bowed.

19
00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:44.106
"Jester, dance! Guard, march!" Emmy said.

20
00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:50.013
"Ugh!" Harry sat down. "I'm tired of marching."

21
00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:54.787
Emmy frowned. "Guards don't get tired!"

22
00:01:54.788 --> 00:01:59.561
Oliver stopped dancing. "I want cookies."

23
00:01:59.562 --> 00:02:02.500
"No!" Emmy said.

24
00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:06.175
"You're too bossy," Harry said.

25
00:02:06.176 --> 00:02:10.550
"We quit!"

26
00:02:10.551 --> 00:02:14.815
"Everyone must bow!" Emmy said.

27
00:02:14.816 --> 00:02:17.368
But no one bowed.

28
00:02:17.369 --> 00:02:23.001
Everyone but Rover left.

29
00:02:23.002 --> 00:02:26.504
Rover sniffed the cookies.

30
00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:29.907
"No!" Emmy said.

31
00:02:29.908 --> 00:02:32.978
Rover turned to go.

32
00:02:32.979 --> 00:02:39.454
"Stay!" Emmy said, but Rover left.

33
00:02:39.455 --> 00:02:45.540
Soon Emmy heard everyone laughing.

34
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:51.276
She sighed. "I'm a sad, lonely queen."

35
00:02:51.277 --> 00:02:57.337
Emmy took her cookies into the kitchen.

36
00:02:57.338 --> 00:03:01.943
"Are you still Queen Emmy?" Mom asked.

37
00:03:01.944 --> 00:03:06.422
Emmy nodded. "But now I'm a good queen."

38
00:03:06.423 --> 00:03:17.084
She held out the plate. "Cookies for everyone!"

